<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Henrique Vieira — Analista de Dados em formação</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg-0:#080a10;
    --bg-1:#0e121b;
    --bg-2:#151b28;
    --line:#232a3a;
    --text-0:#eef0f6;
    --text-1:#9aa3b8;
    --text-2:#5c6478;
    --teal:#00d9c0;
    --violet:#7b6bff;
    --amber:#ffb454;
    --grad: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal), var(--violet));
    --font-display: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    --font-body: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  }

  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:var(--bg-0);
    color:var(--text-0);
    font-family:var(--font-body);
    line-height:1.6;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  ::selection{background:var(--teal);color:var(--bg-0);}

  .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px;}

  /* ---------- background texture ---------- */
  .grid-bg{
    position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(var(--line) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--line) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size:64px 64px;
    opacity:0.35;
    mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 0%, black 30%, transparent 75%);
  }

  /* ---------- nav ---------- */
  header{
    position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:50;
    backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
    background:rgba(8,10,16,0.6);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    padding:18px 28px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;
  }
  .logo{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.02em;
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
  }
  .logo-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--grad);flex-shrink:0;}
  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:32px;font-size:14px;color:var(--text-1);}
  .nav-links a{transition:color .2s;}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--text-0);}
  .nav-cta{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:13px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 16px;border-radius:6px;
    transition:border-color .2s, color .2s;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover{border-color:var(--teal);color:var(--teal);}
  .nav-toggle{display:none;background:none;border:none;color:var(--text-0);font-size:22px;cursor:pointer;}

  @media (max-width:720px){
    .nav-links{
      position:fixed;top:64px;left:0;right:0;
      background:var(--bg-1);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
      flex-direction:column;gap:0;padding:8px 28px;
      transform:translateY(-120%);transition:transform .25s ease;
    }
    .nav-links.open{transform:translateY(0);}
    .nav-links a{padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
    .nav-cta{display:none;}
    .nav-toggle{display:block;}
  }

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    position:relative;z-index:1;
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;
    padding-top:80px;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:13px;color:var(--teal);
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:22px;
    opacity:0;animation:rise .7s ease forwards;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{content:'';width:24px;height:1px;background:var(--teal);}
  h1{
    font-family:var(--font-display);
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(2rem, 4.6vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height:1.15;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    max-width:760px;
    opacity:0;animation:rise .8s ease .1s forwards;
  }
  h1 .accent{
    background:var(--grad);
    -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;
  }
  .hero-sub{
    margin-top:26px;font-size:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.25rem);color:var(--text-1);
    max-width:600px;
    opacity:0;animation:rise .8s ease .25s forwards;
  }
  .hero-row{
    display:flex;gap:16px;margin-top:40px;flex-wrap:wrap;
    opacity:0;animation:rise .8s ease .4s forwards;
  }
  .btn{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:14px;
    padding:13px 26px;border-radius:6px;
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
    transition:transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
  }
  .btn-solid{background:var(--grad);color:#050608;font-weight:600;}
  .btn-solid:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 10px 30px -10px rgba(0,217,192,0.4);}
  .btn-ghost{border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text-0);}
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--text-1);transform:translateY(-2px);}

  @keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}

  .hero-chart{
    position:absolute;right:-4%;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);
    width:46%;max-width:520px;opacity:0.9;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  @media (max-width:900px){.hero-chart{display:none;}}
  .hero-chart path.line{
    fill:none;stroke:url(#lineGrad);stroke-width:2;
    stroke-dasharray:900;stroke-dashoffset:900;
    animation:draw 2.4s cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1) .5s forwards;
  }
  .hero-chart .dot{opacity:0;animation:fadein .4s ease forwards;}
  @keyframes draw{to{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}
  @keyframes fadein{to{opacity:1;}}

  .scroll-cue{
    position:absolute;bottom:36px;left:28px;
    font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--text-2);
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
  }
  .scroll-cue::after{
    content:'';width:1px;height:34px;background:linear-gradient(var(--text-2),transparent);
    animation:pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse{50%{opacity:0.3;}}

  /* ---------- section shell ---------- */
  section{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:120px 0;}
  .section-head{margin-bottom:56px;}
  .tag{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--teal);
    text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.12em;
  }
  h2{
    font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem);
    font-weight:600;margin-top:10px;
  }
  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px);transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}

  /* ---------- about ---------- */
  .about-grid{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:64px;align-items:start;
  }
  @media (max-width:800px){.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .about-text p{color:var(--text-1);font-size:1.02rem;margin-bottom:18px;max-width:56ch;}
  .about-text strong{color:var(--text-0);font-weight:600;}

  .stat-block{
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:26px;
    background:var(--bg-1);
  }
  .stat-block + .stat-block{margin-top:16px;}
  .stat-num{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:1.8rem;color:var(--teal);}
  .stat-label{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:4px;}

  .skills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:32px;}
  .chip{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12.5px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:20px;
    color:var(--text-1);
  }

  /* ---------- experience ---------- */
  .timeline{border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:36px;position:relative;}
  .tl-item{position:relative;padding-bottom:6px;}
  .tl-item::before{
    content:'';position:absolute;left:-41px;top:6px;
    width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg-0);
    border:2px solid var(--teal);
  }
  .tl-role{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:600;}
  .tl-org{color:var(--teal);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:13px;margin-top:4px;}
  .tl-period{color:var(--text-2);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12.5px;margin-top:2px;}
  .tl-desc{color:var(--text-1);margin-top:14px;max-width:58ch;font-size:0.98rem;}

  /* ---------- projects ---------- */
  .proj-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;}
  @media (max-width:820px){.proj-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .proj-card{
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-1), var(--bg-0));
    padding:26px;min-height:220px;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;
    position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .proj-card::after{
    content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 8px, rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 8px, rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 9px);
  }
  .proj-tag{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--text-2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;}
  .proj-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.15rem;margin-top:10px;color:var(--text-1);}
  .proj-soon{
    font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--amber);
    margin-top:auto;padding-top:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
  }
  .proj-soon::before{content:'●';font-size:8px;animation:pulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;}
  .proj-note{
    margin-top:36px;color:var(--text-2);font-size:0.92rem;
    border-left:2px solid var(--line);padding-left:16px;
  }

  /* ---------- contact ---------- */
  .contact-box{
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:56px 40px;
    background:radial-gradient(ellipse at top left, rgba(0,217,192,0.06), transparent 60%),
               radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, rgba(123,107,255,0.06), transparent 60%);
    text-align:center;
  }
  .contact-box h2{margin-top:0;}
  .contact-box p{color:var(--text-1);max-width:50ch;margin:16px auto 34px;}
  .contact-links{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;}

  footer{
    position:relative;z-index:1;
    padding:36px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
    font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);
    flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{animation-duration:0.01ms !important;animation-iteration-count:1 !important;transition-duration:0.01ms !important;}
  }

  /* ---------- mobile refinements ---------- */
  @media (max-width:640px){
    .wrap{padding:0 20px;}
    section{padding:76px 0;}
    .hero{min-height:92vh;padding-top:72px;}
    h1{max-width:100%;}
    .scroll-cue{display:none;}
    .about-grid{gap:36px;}
    .stat-block{padding:20px;}
    .contact-box{padding:40px 22px;border-radius:12px;}
    .contact-links{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;}
    .contact-links .btn{justify-content:center;}
    .timeline{padding-left:26px;}
    .tl-item::before{left:-31px;}
    footer{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="grid-bg"></div>

<header>
  <nav>
    <div class="logo"><span class="logo-dot"></span>HENRIQUE.VIEIRA</div>
    <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#sobre">Sobre</a>
      <a href="#experiencia">Experiência</a>
      <a href="#projetos">Projetos</a>
      <a href="#contato">Contato</a>
    </div>
    <a href="#contato" class="nav-cta">Contato →</a>
    <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Abrir menu">☰</button>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">DISPONÍVEL PARA OPORTUNIDADES · JR. DATA ANALYST</div>
  <h1>Bancário na área de Governança de Finanças, transformando processos manuais em <span class="accent">dashboards</span> e decisões orientadas por dados.</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Henrique Vieira — cursando Análise e Desenvolvimento de Sistemas, construindo a ponte entre o negócio financeiro e a análise de dados.</p>
  <div class="hero-row">
    <a href="#contato" class="btn btn-solid">Vamos conversar</a>
    <a href="#experiencia" class="btn btn-ghost">Ver trajetória</a>
  </div>

  <svg class="hero-chart" viewBox="0 0 400 240" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="lineGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
        <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#00d9c0"/>
        <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#7b6bff"/>
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <path class="line" d="M10 190 L 60 170 L 110 195 L 160 140 L 210 155 L 260 90 L 310 100 L 390 30" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    <circle class="dot" cx="10" cy="190" r="4" fill="#00d9c0" style="animation-delay:.6s"/>
    <circle class="dot" cx="160" cy="140" r="4" fill="#26cbc4" style="animation-delay:1.4s"/>
    <circle class="dot" cx="260" cy="90" r="4" fill="#5b8ce0" style="animation-delay:2s"/>
    <circle class="dot" cx="390" cy="30" r="5" fill="#7b6bff" style="animation-delay:2.6s"/>
  </svg>

  <div class="scroll-cue">SCROLL</div>
</section>

<section id="sobre" class="wrap reveal">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="tag">01 · Sobre</div>
    <h2>Da governança financeira à análise de dados</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-text">
      <p>Comecei minha trajetória profissional na indústria alimentícia, mas foi dentro do <strong>Santander</strong> que encontrei onde tecnologia e impacto se encontram de verdade.</p>
      <p>Hoje, como estagiário na área de <strong>Governança de Finanças</strong> de um dos maiores bancos da América Latina, trabalho diariamente com organização de informações estratégicas, acompanhamento de indicadores e suporte à conformidade de processos financeiros — um contexto que poucos profissionais de dados têm acesso logo no início da carreira.</p>
      <p>Paralelamente, curso <strong>Análise e Desenvolvimento de Sistemas</strong> na UNIP e desenvolvo habilidades em Python, além de dominar Excel avançado e PowerPoint para comunicação de dados. Meu objetivo é conectar essas duas frentes: usar tecnologia para resolver problemas reais do setor financeiro.</p>
      <p>Busco oportunidades como <strong>Analista de Dados Júnior</strong> onde possa aplicar minha visão híbrida — técnica o suficiente para automatizar processos, próxima o suficiente do negócio para saber o que realmente importa analisar.</p>

      <div class="skills">
        <span class="chip">Python</span>
        <span class="chip">Power BI</span>
        <span class="chip">Excel Avançado</span>
        <span class="chip">PowerPoint</span>
        <span class="chip">Governança Financeira</span>
        <span class="chip">Conformidade de Processos</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="stat-block">
        <div class="stat-num">1 ano+</div>
        <div class="stat-label">de atuação no Santander em Governança de Finanças</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-block">
        <div class="stat-num">ADS</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Análise e Desenvolvimento de Sistemas — UNIP</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-block">
        <div class="stat-num">2</div>
        <div class="stat-label">mundos conectados: finanças e dados</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="experiencia" class="wrap reveal">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="tag">02 · Experiência</div>
    <h2>Trajetória profissional</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-role">Estagiário — Governança de Finanças</div>
      <div class="tl-org">Banco Santander</div>
      <div class="tl-period">Há 1 ano · contrato até dezembro de 2026</div>
      <p class="tl-desc">Organização de informações estratégicas, acompanhamento de indicadores e suporte à conformidade de processos financeiros em um dos maiores bancos da América Latina.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="projetos" class="wrap reveal">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="tag">03 · Projetos</div>
    <h2>Em construção</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="proj-grid">
    <div class="proj-card">
      <div><div class="proj-tag">Power BI</div><div class="proj-title">Dashboard de indicadores</div></div>
      <div class="proj-soon">Em breve</div>
    </div>
    <div class="proj-card">
      <div><div class="proj-tag">Python</div><div class="proj-title">Automação de processos</div></div>
      <div class="proj-soon">Em breve</div>
    </div>
    <div class="proj-card">
      <div><div class="proj-tag">Excel · Governança</div><div class="proj-title">Estudo de caso financeiro</div></div>
      <div class="proj-soon">Em breve</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="proj-note">Os primeiros projetos estão a caminho — assim que estiverem prontos para publicação, entram aqui com descrição, tecnologias e link.</p>
</section>

<section id="contato" class="wrap reveal">
  <div class="contact-box">
    <div class="tag">04 · Contato</div>
    <h2>Vamos conversar</h2>
    <p>Aberto a oportunidades como Analista de Dados Júnior. Se meu perfil híbrido — finanças e tecnologia — faz sentido para o seu time, me chama.</p>
    <div class="contact-links">
      <a href="mailto:rickrealtech@gmail.com" class="btn btn-solid">rickrealtech@gmail.com</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/henrique-vieira-482b25370" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-ghost">LinkedIn ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="wrap">
  <div>© 2026 HENRIQUE VIEIRA</div>
  <div>GOVERNANÇA · DADOS · TECNOLOGIA</div>
</footer>

<script>
  // mobile nav toggle
  const navToggle = document.getElementById('navToggle');
  const navLinks = document.getElementById('navLinks');
  navToggle.addEventListener('click', () => navLinks.classList.toggle('open'));
  navLinks.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(a => a.addEventListener('click', () => navLinks.classList.remove('open')));

  // scroll reveal
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    entries.forEach(entry => {
      if (entry.isIntersecting) entry.target.classList.add('in');
    });
  }, { threshold: 0.15 });
  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
</script>

</body>
</html>
